# Wave W17-X (Route 212 — South): bog pine — a bog pine in dark olive greens, tiered and tough, its highlight lifted clear of the turf, on bog turf (ground baked in). Route 212 — South’s own tree — split from Route 212 — North’s drooping pool willow by posture entire and from Route 210’s warm paddock pine by darkness: this pine stands in bog shade, that one in herd sun.
